{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":46,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"a643e4c7-6238-4c7c-a789-59b8a03f3dc7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351572370,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"销售工程师(J16687)","OrgId":2971556,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责区域内动物医院医疗设备销售工作，达成公司下达的销售目标；\n2.客户管理：独立或借助渠道资源，开拓客户关系，建立联系；\n3.渠道管理：业务范围内渠道规划和布局，优化渠道体系，并实施有效管理；\n4.市场推广：独立策划、协调资源、组织推广会、学术会，宣传品牌或达成意向；\n5.业务规划：判断市场形势，为产线年度业务规划提出建设性的意见和建议；\n6.销售管理：整合客户、渠道、展会等内外部资源，获取客户的采购需求。","Require":"1.全日制本科以上学历，动物医学、畜牧兽医类专业优先；\n2.具有3年以上医疗设备销售经验，有动物医疗行业经验者优先，有大客户销售经验者优先，有检验类产品销售经验优先；\n3.具有良好的沟通能力和商务谈判能力，学习能力强，抗压能力强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-02T14:09:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"159faf46-0597-4841-899b-428b8799aef8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351563619,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"学术临床专家(J18055)","OrgId":2971543,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"临床诊疗与困难问题诊断：\n1、主导复杂、疑难病例诊疗，结合迈瑞动物医疗设备的临床应用，制定精准诊疗方案，验证设备在复杂病例中的应用效果，优化设备临床操作流程，提升设备诊疗价值。\n2、负责指定区域内迈瑞动物医疗设备相关临床难题统筹解决，承接区域合作宠物医院的设备应用相关会诊，解决设备临床应用中的技术痛点，提升区域设备应用渗透率与满意度。\n3、深入调研区域内客户对迈瑞动物医疗设备的临床需求、应用痛点及优化建议，结合宠物诊疗实际场景，开展需求分析，形成标准化需求报告，为迈瑞动物医疗设备的研发、迭代升级提供精准临床支撑。\n需求分析与产品验证：\n4、牵头开展迈瑞动物医疗设备的临床验证工作，设计科学的临床试验方案，全程负责试验数据采集、分析、整理，撰写临床验证报告，确保设备符合临床应用标准，推动设备合规落地与市场推广。\n5、跟踪国内外动物医疗设备前沿技术与应用趋势，结合迈瑞产品布局，提出设备功能优化、新品研发的创新建议，推动迈瑞动物医疗设备与宠物临床诊疗场景的深度融合，提升产品核心竞争力。\n内外部培训赋能：\n6、聚焦迈瑞动物医疗设备临床应用、产品操作规范、需求落地等核心内容，开展内外部培训：面向内部团队（研发、营销、用服），开展设备临床应用、产品知识培训；面向区域合作宠物医院及从业者，开展设备操作、应用技巧、故障排查等赋能培训，开发针对性培训课件与教材。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，兽医学或人医临床影像学相关专业，英语读写能作为工作语言；\n2、8年以上兽医工作经验，熟练使用各种临床应用的超声设备，掌握超声常规操作手法及诊断要点，有动物影像临床工作经验者优先；\n3、团队意识强，具备良好的沟通和演讲能力；\n4、具备一定的抗压能力、适应国内国际出差。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-09T13:49:10","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{