egory":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责区域内渠道临床人员带教，负责提升其专业水平及考核管理工作；\n2.负责区域销售人员及代理渠道队伍专业化产品培训支持；\n3.负责协调资源，满足区域内项目售前、售后的临床支持；\n4.负责区域内窗口医院建设，维护区域内重点专家关系；\n5.负责对应产品的市场调研，支持区域推广活动以及产品的宣传和培训；\n6.负责总结对应产品线产品的卖点提炼，主要竞品的竞争分析、话术指引；\n7.完成领导交办的其他工作。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，5年以上工作经验，动物临床医学等相关专业方向；\n2.熟练掌握动物麻醉、监护一种或者多种的临床应用，英语能够满足日常交流；\n3.在医疗圈有一定的专家客户资源；\n4.具备良好的沟通逻辑能力和协调能力；\n5.有团队精神、敬业，能适应出差。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-07-29T10:32:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"103b57ec-0442-41a7-add0-fd93da0dad14","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351621473,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"国际销售工程师（拉美区）(J15023)","OrgId":2971553,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责拉美部分区域的销售目标管理和达成，制定并实施销售计划，独立负责销售业务全过程；\n2. 深度了解动物医疗市场未来发展趋势，深入了解和规划市场，找到增长点和可突破市场；\n3. 划和管理代理商，开拓和挖掘新晋代理商，提升代理商专业性并支持其快速发展；\n4. 规划并组织区域内市场活动，提升迈瑞动物公司品牌知名度和形象。","Req